  },
  "StockRole": "Marksman Juggernaut",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Subjugator is a 120 ton Clan BattleMech with one focus, long range devastating strikes with its Improved Railgun and other weapons. It is slightly less heavily armored than most Superheavy units, but instead relies on other means such as mobility or stealth to be effective in battle. Besides the fixed Improved Railgun in the right torso, the other very interesting thing with the design is the Encased Cybernetic Cockpit; this cockpit encases the piloting MechWarriors in extra thick armor and utilizes a window less design to lower the amount of weakspots.",
